Show HN: 2-command CLI to give AI agents structured data retrieval on PostgreSQL
https://github.com/0xJaksun/lithium-core
{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"0xJaksun"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["open","source","ai","tool"],"value":"<em>AI</em> agents need structured data, not similarity search. Graph DBs are expensive, vector stores are fuzzy.<p>Lithium is a storage engine on PostgreSQL ltree. Hierarchical, versioned, scoped queries. Two commands:<p>npx @lithium-<em>ai</em>/kit init<p>claude mcp add lithium -- npx @lithium-<em>ai</em>/kit serve<p>Your agents get <em>tools</em> to navigate, store, and retrieve structured data on your existing Postgres.<p><em>Open</em> <em>source</em>, MIT."},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"partial","matchedWords":["ai"],"value":"Show HN: 2-command CLI to give <em>AI</em> agents structured data retrieval on PostgreSQL"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://github.com/0xJaksun/lithium-core"}}

